    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27388" root="طوى" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوِيَّةٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَمِير</span> [meaning <i>heart,</i> or <i>mind</i>]:
(S, K, TA:) so called because it is [as though it
were] folded upon the secret, or because the
secret is [as though it were] infolded in it.
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِيَّةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوِىٌّ</span>.

